    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d96">

                <pb facs="0096" n="90" xml:id="pg90"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.60D/100½</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Under Secretary of
                        State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Welles</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-10-21">October 21, 1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <p>The Minister<anchor n="42" xml:id="d96-f1"/> asked me if I could make any
                    statement to him with regard to the relations between Finland and the United
                    States which would relieve his mind in view of his approaching confinement to
                    the hospital. I said that there were no developments since I had previously
                    talked with the Minister and that the situation still remained on a 24-hour
                    basis.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>S[<hi rendition="#small-caps">umner</hi>] W[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >elles</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d96-f1" n="42" xml:id="d96-f1-content">
                <p>Hjalmar J. Procopé, Minister of Finland.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
